{"title":"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_1:_Solving\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1: Solving</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_2:_Process_of_Elimination\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2: Process of Elimination</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9abe0e065dfea81f7e2f4d0dfcc6b95736c51054.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^p + 3^4 = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b0902c4376e88c0cf6c9094e52fd98e578515d09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^r + 44 = 76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad35e16888676ef6fee0bd008f32ba2d9f1ccea7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^3 + 6^s = 1421$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, what is the product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8cc97b1d8f54b858ec2068645d6b8e93976047cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 27 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 40 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 50 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 70 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=301\">https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=301</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ew7QnjAAHcw\">https://youtu.be/ew7QnjAAHcw</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1:_Solving\">Solution 1: Solving</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1: Solving\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>First, we're going to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01fda63f86b83a8b67fc5b17147669c17613ec80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^p+3^4=90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />. Then, change <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/2259c263bde7b68aadfeca3df73046a41c953212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^4$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. Subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> from both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a897ec3f045b432db295bc0009211b7816d823e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^p=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> and see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Now, solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/9/6f98a91fcf8f7251eaeb2b13365b643c98643361.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^r+44=76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/d/a2d230fae6558a1a3ada3c4452aeb2561e9a0e71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8cc63d5667f0a88fc3d53c6d20c92b5be6dd5595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=5$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. Now, solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/150ca948593ef73844d18630b1548f814666b847.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^3+6^s=1421$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/b/16bb52800c7b17dabd3f2a3efaa08d559ec35a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125+6^s=1421$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"125\" height=\"14\" /> which simplifies further to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/2579a0bb6241164cd36d1505ffec45da6172bab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^s=1296$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/8/e18f0adcd75f4954ae25630f7714a0a3d1d2ba92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e34805bf67fee4f6e853234a2b675c5b9cb9b4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$prs$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/c/1cc8cef09ef94fce869898743589b4518548b7c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2*5*4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> which equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/0302cc646fc04cbb7ea3544dbe62ede815267593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2:_Process_of_Elimination\">Solution 2: Process of Elimination</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2: Process of Elimination\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>First, we solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. As Solution 1 perfectly states, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/150ca948593ef73844d18630b1548f814666b847.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^3+6^s=1421$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/b/16bb52800c7b17dabd3f2a3efaa08d559ec35a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125+6^s=1421$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"125\" height=\"14\" /> which simplifies further to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/2579a0bb6241164cd36d1505ffec45da6172bab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^s=1296$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/8/e18f0adcd75f4954ae25630f7714a0a3d1d2ba92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. We know that you cannot take a root of any of the numbers raised to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and get a rational answer, and none of the answer choices are irrational, so that rules out the possibility that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is a fraction. The only answer choice that is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/0302cc646fc04cbb7ea3544dbe62ede815267593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 8\">2013 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2013\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232032\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 285/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2272/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7423/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.482      1 -total\n 58.13%    7.837      1 Template:AMC8_box\n 39.43%    5.316      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12192:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232032 and revision id 185133. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}